---
import Private from '../../layouts/Private.astro';
import F from '../../components/PrivateFigure.astro';
const p = '/private/holmes-sage';
---
<Private
  title="SAGE portal workshop analysis"
  client="Holmes Corporation"
  color="#5B3FD6"
  back={{ href: '/work/holmes', label: 'Holmes Corporation case study' }}
  intro="The readout I prepared after facilitating the SAGE portal workshop: what stakeholders expect from the portal, the themes behind it, and the priorities and next steps we agreed on."
>
  <F src={`${p}/01-analysis-cover.jpg`} width={2000} height={1161} alt="Cover slide: SAGE Portal Workshop Analysis, a renewed understanding of SAGE, where it started and where it could go" />

  <h2>What we heard</h2>
  <p>Stakeholders were enthusiastic about a more personalized, engaging portal, and pragmatic about technical debt, integration and resources. Four audiences came out of the workshop with different needs: early-career professionals, certified individuals, corporate partners and internal staff.</p>
  <F src={`${p}/02-overview-summary.jpg`} width={2000} height={1546} alt="Overview summary slide with themes, audience segments and key considerations" caption="Overview, audience segments and key considerations." />

  <h2>Where SAGE is headed</h2>
  <F src={`${p}/03-vision.jpg`} width={2000} height={1166} alt="Vision slide: guide career growth, foster connections and enhance continuous professional development" caption="The vision statement the group aligned on." />
  <F src={`${p}/04-key-outcomes.jpg`} width={2000} height={1499} alt="Key outcomes: high user engagement, clear ROI for stakeholders, sustainable revenue growth, scalable and flexible platform" caption="Four outcomes the portal has to deliver." />

  <h2>What to do first</h2>
  <p>We placed every idea on a priority and feasibility matrix, then turned the high-priority, high-feasibility ideas into next steps and action items.</p>
  <F src={`${p}/07-priority-matrix-board.jpg`} width={2800} height={2894} alt="Priority matrix board with ideas plotted by priority and feasibility" caption="The priority matrix from the session." />
  <F src={`${p}/05-priority-matrix-analysis.jpg`} width={2800} height={2028} alt="Priority matrix analysis with grouped findings beside the matrix" caption="The matrix with the analysis behind each group." />
  <F src={`${p}/06-next-steps-action-items.jpg`} width={2000} height={2216} alt="Next steps and a numbered list of 16 action items" caption="Next steps and 16 action items." />
  <F src={`${p}/08-recommended-next-steps.jpg`} width={2000} height={972} alt="Eight recommended next steps, from a structured testing program to co-created journeys" caption="My recommended next steps for the research and design work." />
</Private>
